{"msg_id": "m0024", "timestamp": "2026-10-28T06:19:57.353955", "sender": {"wechat_id": "wx_wangyiran", "nickname": "王艺燃"}, "type": "text", "content": "要按标准 SKILL.md 格式来写，我看了课程文档，里面有触发词、输入输出和依赖三个必填部分，你对照着填就行。", "media_ref": null, "reply_to": "m0023", "_label": "answer", "_gold_refs": ["C4"]}
