{"msg_id": "m0026", "timestamp": "2026-10-28T09:44:01.878770", "sender": {"wechat_id": "wx_luyao", "nickname": "陆遥"}, "type": "text", "content": "git push 的时候报错 non-fast-forward 怎么办？我卡了半小时了", "media_ref": null, "reply_to": null, "_label": "question", "_gold_refs": ["C5"]}
{"msg_id": "m0027", "timestamp": "2026-10-28T11:49:05.457517", "sender": {"wechat_id": "wx_gaofei", "nickname": "高飞"}, "type": "text", "content": "先 git pull --rebase origin main 再 push。报错的原因是你本地分支落后于远端，rebase 把你的提交挪到远端最新提交之后就可以了。", "media_ref": null, "reply_to": "m0026", "_label": "answer", "_gold_refs": ["C5"]}
{"msg_id": "m0028", "timestamp": "2026-10-28T15:25:59.682391", "sender": {"wechat_id": "wx_luyao", "nickname": "陆遥"}, "type": "text", "content": "搞定了，感谢！", "media_ref": null, "reply_to": null, "_label": "social", "_gold_refs": []}
