{"msg_id": "m0065", "timestamp": "2026-10-31T16:37:53.552420", "sender": {"wechat_id": "wx_yeqi", "nickname": "叶琪"}, "type": "text", "content": "必须开源，而且 README 里要写清楚安装和使用说明，这是产物完整性的评分维度之一。私有仓库评审老师看不到。", "media_ref": null, "reply_to": "m0064", "_label": "answer", "_gold_refs": ["C5"]}
