{"msg_id": "m0099", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T04:30:27.841222", "sender": {"wechat_id": "wx_dengke", "nickname": "邓科"}, "type": "text", "content": "先看浏览器控制台有没有报错。如果是端口问题，检查你本地的服务是否还活着；如果是路径问题，大概率是 build 之后 index.html 里的资源引用是绝对路径，改成相对路径重新 build 一次。", "media_ref": null, "reply_to": "m0098", "_label": "answer", "_gold_refs": ["C6"]}
{"msg_id": "m0100", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T05:35:33.550967", "sender": {"wechat_id": "wx_maliang", "nickname": "马亮"}, "type": "text", "content": "原来是路径问题，解决了，谢谢！", "media_ref": null, "reply_to": null, "_label": "social", "_gold_refs": []}
