{"msg_id": "m0117", "timestamp": "2026-11-04T16:49:20.590728", "sender": {"wechat_id": "wx_zhouyu", "nickname": "周雨"}, "type": "text", "content": "proposal 里的 KSTAR 结构是什么意思？第一次见这种写法", "media_ref": null, "reply_to": null, "_label": "question", "_gold_refs": ["C8"]}
{"msg_id": "m0118", "timestamp": "2026-11-04T17:02:22.253888", "sender": {"wechat_id": "wx_wangyiran", "nickname": "王艺燃"}, "type": "text", "content": "K 是已有知识和资源，S 是当前情境，T 是任务分解，A 是行动计划，R 是预期结果。整个挑战体系都在用这个循环，AAR 里的 R 和 R 对比就是它的学习信号。", "media_ref": null, "reply_to": "m0117", "_label": "answer", "_gold_refs": ["C8"]}
{"msg_id": "m0119", "timestamp": "2026-11-04T18:00:15.895140", "sender": {"wechat_id": "wx_zhouyu", "nickname": "周雨"}, "type": "text", "content": "原来如此，清楚了", "media_ref": null, "reply_to": null, "_label": "social", "_gold_refs": []}
{"msg_id": "m0120", "timestamp": "2026-11-04T20:21:38.995140", "sender": {"wechat_id": "wx_wuqiang", "nickname": "吴强"}, "type": "text", "content": "拿来说明是什么？和参考文献有什么区别？", "media_ref": null, "reply_to": null, "_label": "question", "_gold_refs": ["C8"]}
